  "id": "assertiveness-training",
  "term": "assertiveness training",
  "definition": "Assertiveness training is a behavioral learning approach used to strengthen interpersonal relationships by teaching socially appropriate behavior and helping people express their opinions and needs clearly. In practice, it emphasizes self-expression while taking the social situation and other people into account so communication remains effective rather than seeming aggressive.",
